#: home/templates/dashboard.html:10 home/templates/dashboard.html:17
msgid "Dashboard"
msgstr "Dashboard"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:14
msgid "Zur Homepage"
msgstr "To the Homepage"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:30
#, python-format
msgid "Willkommen, %(username)s!"
msgstr "Welcome, %(username)s!"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:33
msgid ""
"Bitte bestätige deine E-Mail-Adresse, um alle Funktionen nutzen zu können. "
"Falls du keine\n"
"            Verifizierungsmail erhalten hast,"
msgstr ""
"Please confirm your email address to access all features. If you haven't "
"received a verification email,"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:35
msgid "lasse dir eine neue senden."
msgstr "request a new one."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:41
msgid "Tour starten"
msgstr "Start tour"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:46
msgid ""
"Klicke hier, um eine klimafreundliche Aktion einzutragen, die du zuvor "
"durchgeführt hast, einzutragen und dafür Klimapunkte zu erhalten."
msgstr ""
"Click here to add a climate-friendly action which you carried out before to "
"receive climate points."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:46
msgid "Aktion eintragen"
msgstr "Log Action"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:55
msgid "Benachrichtigungen anfordern"
msgstr "Request Notifications"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:56
msgid ""
"Über Push-Benachrichtigungen können wir dir Mitteilungen direkt an dieses "
"Gerät senden."
msgstr ""
"Via push notifications, we can send you messages directly to this device."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:70
msgid ""
"Tipp: Wenn andere Nutzer Artikel liken, die du selbst geschrieben hast, "
"erhältst du Klimapunkte!\n"
"        Schreibe also selbst einen guten Artikel, um mehr Klimapunkte zu "
"erhalten!"
msgstr ""
"Tip: When other users like articles you've written, you earn climate points! "
"So write a great article yourself to earn more climate points!"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:75
msgid "Zur öffentlichen Profilseite"
msgstr "To the Public Profile Page"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:82
msgid ""
"Klicke hier, um zur <b>Hall of Fame</b> zu gelangen. Regelmäßig werden von "
"uns Quests wie <i>Sammle diese Woche mindestens 50 Klimapunkte</i> "
"veröffentlicht. Schaffst du das, wirst du in die Hall of Fame aufgenommen."
msgstr ""
"Click here to get to the <b>hall of fame</b>. Regularly, we publish quests "
"like <i>collect at least 50 climate points this week</i>. If you make this "
"quest, you´ll be inducted into the hall of fame."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:82 home/templates/home.html:319
msgid "Zur Hall of Fame"
msgstr "To the hall of fame"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:87
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Du bist auf Platz <strong>#%(rank)s</strong> im worldwide\n"
"        ranking"
msgstr "You are ranked <strong>#%(rank)s</strong> in the worldwide ranking"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:89
#, python-format
msgid "Du hast <strong>%(entries)s</strong> Einträge in der Hall of Fame"
msgstr "You have <strong>%(entries)s</strong> entries in the hall of fame"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:244
msgid "Perfekte Woche"
msgstr "Perfect Week"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:247
msgid ""
"Die <b>perfekte Woche</b> kannst du erreichen, wenn du Aktionen aus jeder "
"Kategorie eingetragen und dein wöchentliches Ziel erreicht hast."
msgstr ""
"You can reach the <b>perfect week</b> if you logged actions from every "
"category and reached your weekly goal."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:252 home/templates/dashboard.html:281
msgid "Wöchentliches Ziel"
msgstr "Weekly Goal"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:272
msgid "Du hast eine perfekte Woche!"
msgstr "You have a perfect week!"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:284
msgid ""
"Das <b>wöchentliche Ziel</b> gibt an, wie viele Klimapunkte du jede Woche "
"erreichen willst. Du kannst es selbstständig verändern."
msgstr ""
"The <b>weekly goal</i> indicates how many climate points you want to reach "
"every week. You can change it on your own."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:293
#, python-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"        %(weekly_klimapunkte)s Klimapunkte bis zum wöchentlichen Ziel von\n"
"        %(weekly_goal)s Klimapunkten geschafft"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"        %(weekly_klimapunkte)s climate points towards the weekly goal of\n"
"        %(weekly_goal)s climate points achieved"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:297
msgid "Ziel ändern"
msgstr "Change Goal"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:408
msgid "Streak"
msgstr "Streak"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:411
msgid ""
"Die <b>Streak</b> gibt an, wie oft das wöchentliche Ziel hintereinander "
"erreicht wurde."
msgstr ""
"The <b>streak</b> indicates how often the weekly goal was achieved "
"consecutively."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:418
msgid "Aktuelle Streak"
msgstr "Current Streak"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:422
msgid "Wochen mit erreichtem wöchentlichen Ziel"
msgstr "weeks with weekly goal achieved"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:427
msgid "Du hast dein wöchentliches Ziel diese Woche bereits erreicht"
msgstr "You have already reached your weekly goal this week"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:428
msgid "Du hast dein wöchentliches Ziel diese Woche noch nicht erreicht"
msgstr "You haven't reached your weekly goal this week yet"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:435
msgid "Klimapunkte"
msgstr "Climate Points"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:437
msgid ""
"Die <b>Klimapunkte</b> geben an, wie viele Klimapunkte du insgesamt bereits "
"gesammelt hast."
msgstr ""
"The <b>climate points</b> indicate, how many climate points you already "
"collected overall."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:438
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Du hast bereits\n"
"            %(klimapunkte)s Klimapunkte\n"
"            gesammelt."
msgstr "You have already collected %(klimapunkte)s climate points."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:442
msgid "Zu den Klimapunkten"
msgstr "To Climate Points"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:447
msgid "Level"
msgstr "Level"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:449
msgid ""
"Je nachdem, wie viele Klimapunkte du bereits insgesamt gesammelt hast, "
"besitzt du ein anderes <b>Level</b>."
msgstr ""
"Depending on how many Climate Points you have accumulated in total so "
"far,you hold a different <b>level</b>."

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:449
msgid "Du bist im Level"
msgstr "You are at level"

#: home/templates/dashboard.html:453
msgid "Zu den Levels"
msgstr "To Levels"

